# Battery Alert Android App - Cursor IDE Rules

## Project Overview
This is an Android application that monitors battery charging level and alerts users when the battery reaches a configurable threshold (default 80%) to help preserve battery health.

## Core Features
- Real-time battery level monitoring
- Customizable battery threshold (0-100%)
- Alarm sound notification when threshold is reached
- Background service for continuous monitoring
- Notification with custom ringtone selection
- Auto-start on device boot
- Battery optimization exemption handling

## Tech Stack
- **Language**: Kotlin (preferred) / Java
- **Min SDK**: API 21 (Android 5.0 Lollipop)
- **Target SDK**: Android 10
- **Architecture**: MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel)
- **Build System**: Gradle with Kotlin DSL
- **UI Framework**: Material Design 3
- **Dependency Injection**: Hilt
- **Async Operations**: Coroutines + Flow
- **Background Processing**: WorkManager + Foreground Service
- **Local Storage**: SharedPreferences / DataStore
- **Database** (if needed): Room

