## Common Issues & Solutions

### Issue 1: Service killed in background
- Use Foreground Service with proper notification
- Request battery optimization exemption
- Implement WorkManager as fallback

### Issue 2: Notification not showing
- Check notification permission (Android 13+)
- Verify NotificationChannel is created
- Check Do Not Disturb settings

### Issue 3: Alarm sound not playing
- Check audio focus
- Verify ringtone URI is valid
- Handle silent mode appropriately

### Issue 4: Not starting after reboot
- Ensure RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED permission
- Check if app is in stopped state
- Implement DirectBootAware if needed

